# direnv: put this project's command on PATH while inside the checkout (run `direnv allow` once).
# The command enters the project's nix develop environment itself, so no `use flake` is needed.
# `dune` is the short name, offered only when no `dune` executable is already on PATH (OCaml's build tool has that
# name); an alias or shell function named dune outranks PATH anyway. `dune-awakening` always works.
has dune || PATH_add bin/short
PATH_add bin
